The Responses-API state strip (`ProviderConfig::strip_responses_state`,
`stripResponsesState()` in `core/src/lr_protocol.cpp`) is a port of
codex-strip-proxy by AnnaofArendelle, originally distributed as
`codex_strip_proxy.py`:

  https://github.com/AnnaofArendelle/codex-strip-proxy

The technique it implements — removing item ids, `encrypted*` fields and
`previous_response_id` from a `/v1/responses` request so that a relay pooling
several Azure OpenAI resources can serve it — was worked out and measured
there. This port keeps the same behaviour and attribution.
